"content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0137","question_id":"CQ-Q0137","citation_id":"smp-be2dcd2fec2d4ca395c5d3e660344664:12","title":"听说你一发手卡达人就不回复了？ #手卡 #建联手卡 #建联达人 #达人分销达哥 #电商","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7522817122964147506","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7522817122964147506","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0137","question_id":"CQ-Q0137","citation_id":"smp-be2dcd2fec2d4ca395c5d3e660344664:13","title":"商务bd课：开场白怎么说 新手小白必须看完的一节课，不然你都不知道怎么跟达人说第一句话#达人营销 #达人商务 #商务bd #达人资源","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7629182268354891048","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7629182268354891048","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0137","question_id":"CQ-Q0137","citation_id":"smp-be2dcd2fec2d4ca395c5d3e660344664:14","title":"达人建联讲不清楚三件事，活该不带你的品。 #达人分销  #达人对接  #达人建联  #鹿七达人分销  #达人带货","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7656433030986337599","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7656433030986337599","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0137","question_id":"CQ-Q0137","citation_id":"smp-be2dcd2fec2d4ca395c5d3e660344664:15","title":"商务BD✅添加达人以后，千万不要说在吗❓。⭕一、核心底层逻辑：“在吗” 是建联低回复根源 . 达人日均接收 20～80 条商务消息，只发在吗 = 无价值空提问，3 个致命弊端： . 🧩增加达人沟通成本：达人不清楚来意、品类、合作价值，还要反问 “什么事”，下意识搁置消息、已读不回；  . 🧩被归类群发骚扰 BD：空泛开场白 = 批量广撒网，达人判定你没做账号调研、诚意不足，直接忽略；  . 🧩错失","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7648265594143423717","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7648265594143423717","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_su